* Priority Queue ->

A Priority Queue is a special type of queue where elements are removed/processed according to their priority, rather than simply following FIFO 

In a normal queue: Insert: 10, 20, 30, 40
Queue: 10 → 20 → 30 → 40

Remove → 10.. The first element inserted is removed first.

Priority Queue ->

* In a priority queue: 
Insert: 10, 5, 30, 2
Priority: 2 > 5 > 10 > 30

if Remove → Then 2 remove first ....Then -> 5 , 10 , 30
Remove → 5
Remove → 10
Remove → 30

So: Priority Queue removes the element with the highest priority first.

