9.  Priority Queue Operations ->

    There are three important operations.
-    insert():  Adds an element  ->        PQ.insert(10)
-    peek():    Returns highest-priority element without removing it.   ->        PQ.peek()
-    remove():  Removes the highest-priority element.                   ->        PQ.remove()

